<p style="font:10pt Times New Roman;margin:0"><kbd style="margin-left:7.2pt"></kbd>As a subsequent event, through March 23, 2026 UTMD purchased 1,196 additional shares of its common stock for $67 including commissions and fees (an average price of $55.88/ share).&#160;</p>
