<p style="font:10pt Times New Roman;margin:0"><kbd style="margin-left:9pt"></kbd>Because revenue results for any given three-month period in comparison with a previous three-month period are not indicative of comparative results for the year as a whole, UTMD suggests that investors should focus primarily on the annual results in 2025.&#160;</p>
<p style="font:10pt Times New Roman;margin:0">&#160;</p>
