<p style="font:10pt Times New Roman;margin:0"> &#160;&#160;&#160;UTMD&#8217;s China distributor for Deltran blood pressure monitoring kits (Item 2), for which a non-changeable/noncancellable order in late 2024 for 2025 shipments was surprisingly cancelled just before the final shipment in 3Q 2025, resulted in $431 lower revenues than had been committed, and $310 lower sales than in 2024. Furthermore, $0.4 million of the $2.1 million sales in 2025 was written off in G&amp;A expense as an uncollectible receivable.  </p>
<hr style="border:0;height:0;width:0;margin:14pt 0 0 0"/><p style="font:10pt Times New Roman;margin:0;text-align:center">21</p>
