</td><td valign="top" style="width:19.7%;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000"><p style="font:10pt Times New Roman;margin:0"><kbd style="position:absolute;text-align:right;font:10pt Times New Roman;width:81pt">(1)</kbd>&#160;</p>
